        "title": "平均速度：等时与等距",
        "prompt": "两段等时与两段等距，应分别怎样处理平均速度？"
      },
      "collection": "方法判断",
      "recallGoal": "依据等时／等距条件识别平均速度处理方法。",
      "contextRationale": "总路程／总时间、等时等距规则、两段等距公式和多段范围提醒完整保留。",
      "boundaryRationale": "以条件辨识为主，公式为方法承接；不是另一张基础公式卡。",
      "independentReviewFocus": "两个原规则块部分重复，后续可提出精简建议；本批不为压短而删条件。",
      "authorInspection": "context-inspected-not-approved",
      "sources": [
        {
          "sourceFile": "miniprogram/models/note-quantity/points/travel.json",
          "subjectId": "quantity",
          "pointId": "travel-average-speed",
          "pointTitle": "等距离平均速度",
          "tabId": "knowledge",
          "tabTitle": "知识点",
          "expectedTabSha256": "a456b38fcba7c8e300b4a484f0ca168176fb12e37da06f2beb19cc804eb849b5",
          "originalBlocks": [
            {
              "selection": {
                "blockIndex": 0,
                "expectedBlockSha256": "0165a6dcee6bfa3a12b7415469a13e4f0bbbc8c297a0957dd7b03daf130b2c3f"
              },
              "originalBlock": {
                "type": "formula",
                "label": "普通平均速度",
                "content": "v均 = 总路程 / 总时间"
              }
            },
            {
              "selection": {
                "blockIndex": 1,
                "expectedBlockSha256": "cb624ff406282c9457d3155ef588757e08c57d832d454665be18033f2f402a38"
              },
              "originalBlock": {
                "type": "rule",
                "title": "普通平均速度",
                "items": [
                  "平均速度一律先用总路程÷总时间。",
                  "若各段时间相等，平均速度等于各段速度的算术平均数。",
                  "若各段路程相等，不能直接取算术平均数，要用等距离平均速度。"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "selection": {
                "blockIndex": 2,
                "expectedBlockSha256": "73fd615e8d080bb002e038cff35586fdb6fadeb3771a18e9ba83670ec8f3c67c"
              },
              "originalBlock": {
                "type": "formula",
                "label": "两段等距",
                "content": "v均 = 2v1v2 / (v1 + v2)",
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "type": "script",
                    "base": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "V"
                    },
                    "sub": "均"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "op",
                    "value": "="
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "frac",
                    "numNodes": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "2"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "script",
                        "base": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "value": "V"
                        },
                        "sub": "1"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "script",
                        "base": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "value": "V"
                        },
                        "sub": "2"
                      }
                    ],
                    "denNodes": [
                      {
                        "type": "script",
                        "base": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "value": "V"
                        },
                        "sub": "1"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "op",
                        "value": "+"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "script",
                        "base": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "value": "V"
                        },
                        "sub": "2"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "selection": {
                "blockIndex": 3,
                "expectedBlockSha256": "36e21f3241122276e630faf5b0b792a5ff20745dc3b91f0156735da89f3c5d96"
              },
              "originalBlock": {
                "type": "rule",
                "title": "解题规则",
                "items": [
                  "往返或多段路程相等时，不能直接取速度的算术平均数。",
                  "两段等距离平均速度：v均 = 2v1v2/(v1+v2)。",
                  "多段等距离时，可设每段距离为同一个方便数，分别求时间后用总路程÷总时间。",
                  "判断关键是各段距离相等；若各段时间相等，平均速度才等于速度的算术平均数。"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
